  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposed first-floor rear infill extension, by reason of its full-width form and the infilling of the void between the original rear outriggers, would remove an established visual break that contributes positively to the character and articulation of the terrace. The resulting built form would appear overly bulky and dominant and would fail to remain subordinate to the host dwelling, overwhelming its original architectural composition. The proposal is therefore contrary to the policies D1 ( London’s form, character and capacity for growth ), D3 ( Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach ), and D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and policy LP1 ( Design Quality and Local Character ) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and Hackney ’s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
